 business was a woman that was 102 years  old and nothing ever came close to the  cookie that she had at gideon's fake  house  this cookie stands out amongst other  chocolate chip cookies because it's got  a lot of those chocolate chips it's  seriously like biting through a barrier  of chocolate to get to the cookie it's  really moist and dense and buttery and  lots of chocolate power in there but if  you're in orlando i think it's  definitely worth giving them a try all  the foods i'm trying today are homemade  creations from orlando locals and our  next food is made with less than 10  ingredients that are all made from  scratch and locally sourced  sugar rush marshmallows was started by  wife and wife team julie and jean  summers back in 2016. making these  marshmallows is not easy each batch has  six layers of color from red to purple  and takes about six hours to make  after the layering process the  marshmallows need to sit for 24 to 48  hours before they can be cut powdered  and packaged when we make our sugar  syrup we make our vanilla extract we  make any of our extracts and flavorings  we make our source locally to try to  highlight local flavors and but then on  top of that to make it a little bit  extra special we make our own graham  crackers so it's a lot of extra work but  we think that it's definitely worth it  to have that  extra special experience i think sets  our marshmallows apart  there's such a soft spot in my heart for  a beautiful rainbow dessert and this  s'more is truly one of a kind  oh my god  i love this rainbow s'more because they  take something so classic and simple  and they turn it into something so fun  and decadent  the marshmallow is the most delicious  marshmallow i've ever had the graham  crackers are buttery homemade throw it  all together i'm over the moon for this  over the rainbow after two delicious  sweet treats i'm trying a limited  edition sweet and spicy combo that has  taken the internet by storm it's a hot  fried chicken sandwich on a mochi donut  bun i mean just even when we announced  it just as a teaser announcement i mean  we got so many hits on social media just  people like when is it coming out what  is this you know i want to see it and as  soon as we showed first pictures of it i  mean people started going insane over it  about 10 45 there's a line of about 25  people waiting to get this sandwich  we knew obviously it's an instagramable  thing it's something they both look  really nice really pretty together but  the actual flavors really went well  together because the the doji is a nice  like way with the mochi flower the rice  flour so it's really crispy on the  outside but kind of chewy on the texture  on the inside and our hot chicken how we  do it and how we make it it's really  nice and crispy on the outside as well  and then our  chicken's really juicy and nice so it's  like all the textures went together like  a layer of similar texture so it went  together really nicely so it's been very  limited and  and truth be told each time it's  completely sold out i mean we've sold  out down to the last tinder and  obviously there's limitations in terms  of being on a trailer in terms of how  much but i mean i'm talking several  cases of chickens gone there's nothing i  love more than a culinary contrast  meaning two flavors that are completely  different but bring a beautiful marriage  together  [Music]  oh  oh it's hot now  we went from sweet  to hot  whoa  oh no  it's hot oh my god i am on fire right  now the fact that this is the mild  sandwich if i had the hot sandwich i  would have to truly go to the hospital i  mean  i think they're culinary geniuses  i tried so many amazing foods today and  this might be the hardest decision i've  had to make between gideon's famous  cookies sugar rush's amazing marshmallow  rainbow s'more and the douchey chicken  fire sandwich i had some of the most  interesting foods here than i've ever  had but  my favorite is the rainbow s'